From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 04:59:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mutter: animate workspace switches from gnoblin specs

---
